                      "textAlign": null
                    },
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Utah State University academic advisors provide an inclusive environment in which the advisor assists undergraduate students in making responsible and informed decisions about educational plans, professional goals, and life outlooks consistent with the student's strengths, values, abilities, and interests. Advisors at USU are committed to the best professional practices to serve students."
